flowchart TB
 E[OAuth / manual sync / daily maintenance] --> W[Create or resume sync run]
 W --> P[Read saved tracks / at most 50 per page]
 P --> TX[One SQL transaction: metadata + seen set + next offset]
 TX --> MORE{More pages?}
 MORE -->|yes| P
 MORE -->|no| VALID{Consistent total and unique coverage?}
 VALID -->|no| RESTART[Start another full pass]
 VALID -->|yes| MATCH{Same ID + liked-at set as consecutive valid pass?}
 MATCH -->|no prior or different| RESTART
 RESTART --> P
 MATCH -->|yes| COMMIT[Mark complete + soft-remove unseen + revision]
 COMMIT --> GATE[Initial generation gate opens]